                                                "sense_id": "9fb8044c-a715-3117-80a8-b16a39b18991",
                                                "text": "While MS-13 is not the only transnational gang this administration will target, we believe the following background information attributed as “information provided by the Justice Department” will be helpful: […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4659c39b-0535-4573-94e9-91385affa46a",
                                                "sense_id": "9fb8044c-a715-3117-80a8-b16a39b18991",
                                                "text": "The Biden administration will designate a dangerous Venezuelan gang infiltrating the United States as a significant transnational criminal organization on Thursday, according to a senior administration official, who described the gang as an “emerging threat.”"
                                            }
                                        ]
